-- Updated Leo entries — planet-specific
DELETE FROM kb_planet_in_sign WHERE sign = 'Leo';

INSERT INTO kb_planet_in_sign (planet, sign, summary, life_patterns, relationships, challenges, growth, book_references) VALUES

('Sun', 'Leo',
 'Your core identity radiates confidence, creativity, and natural charisma. You are wired to lead, create, and express yourself authentically—this is the Sun''s home. Leo Sun is the ultimate expression of solar energy: unapologetically YOU.',
 'You live to create and make an impact. Whether through art, leadership, or pure presence, you need to be seen and celebrated. Your days are organized around creative pursuits and moments where you can shine. You naturally step into spotlight roles without apology. Life feels alive when you''re expressing your unique gifts.',
 'You love with fierce loyalty and expect admiration in return. You''re generous with attention and affection, but need to feel valued and special. In intimate relationships, you crave a partner who celebrates you and doesn''t dim your light. You bring warmth, playfulness, and deep devotion.',
 'Your biggest trap is needing constant validation and becoming melodramatic when you don''t get it. Pride can isolate you or make you defensive about criticism. You may overshadow others'' needs in your drive to lead. Learning that self-worth doesn''t depend on applause is essential.',
 'Channel your need for recognition into meaningful creative contribution. Lead because you genuinely want to elevate others, not just be admired. Cultivate humility by recognizing that true confidence doesn''t require an audience. Your light is brightest when it inspires rather than dominates.',
 ARRAY['Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''ll Ever Need', 'Hand, Planets in Transit', 'Forrest, The Inner Sky']),

('Moon', 'Leo',
 'Your emotional world is theatrical, warm, and deeply loyal. You need to feel special and appreciated, and you give affection generously. Leo Moon experiences feelings intensely and expresses them dramatically—your emotions demand an audience.',
 'You need validation and reassurance that you''re loved and valued. Creating beauty and joy around you soothes your emotional pain. You''re drawn to people, events, and experiences that make you feel alive and celebrated. Your moods can shift from sunny to wounded if you feel overlooked or unappreciated.',
 'You''re a deeply loyal and warm-hearted friend and partner. You show your emotions openly and generously offer your heart. In intimate connections, you want to be adored and to adore in return. You create safe spaces for others to feel special and celebrated, just as you need to feel.',
 'Emotional dependency on others'' approval can make you fragile and reactive. You struggle when circumstances prevent you from being in the spotlight. Rejection or coldness cuts deep because you give so openly. Learning to self-soothe without external validation is your growing edge.',
 'Develop your own creative outlets that feed your emotional needs independently. Practice self-love as actively as you love others. Recognize that quiet, consistent loyalty is as valuable as dramatic expression. Your emotional warmth is a gift—don''t weaponize it when hurt.',
 ARRAY['Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''ll Ever Need', 'Hall, The Twelve Houses', 'Forrest, The Inner Sky']),

('Mercury', 'Leo',
 'Your thinking style is bold, expressive, and confidence-driven. You communicate with flair and aren''t afraid to voice strong opinions. Mercury in Leo speaks to be heard—your ideas deserve attention and you''ll make sure they get it.',
 'You think in big pictures and grand narratives rather than minute details. Your communication style is warm, theatrical, and persuasive. You''re drawn to subjects that allow for creative interpretation and personal expression. Your mind works best when you can take center stage in conversations or projects.',
 'You''re a natural storyteller and engaging conversationalist. People are drawn to your animated way of speaking and your genuine interest in connecting. You express admiration openly and make others feel intelligent and valued when you listen. Your speech is generous, rarely petty, and often playful.',
 'You can be stubborn about defending your viewpoint, especially when you feel your opinions are being dismissed. Your need to be right can override curiosity about other perspectives. You may dominate conversations without realizing others haven''t had space to speak. Arrogance about your ideas can limit learning.',
 'Ask questions before asserting your viewpoint. Practice deep listening without planning your response. Recognize that the best ideas often come from collaborative thinking, not solo genius. Your confidence is powerful—use it to uplift others'' ideas, not just promote your own.',
 ARRAY['Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''ll Ever Need', 'Hand, Planets in Transit', 'Arroyo, Astrology, Psychology, and the Four Elements']),

('Venus', 'Leo',
 'Your love style is passionate, generous, and deeply romantic. You give wholeheartedly and expect the same in return. Venus in Leo wants to be adored—and you''re more than willing to provide that same passionate devotion to your beloved.',
 'You court with flair and aren''t shy about expressing affection physically and emotionally. Beauty, luxury, and status appeal to you, especially if they reflect your good taste. You''re loyal and protective of those you love, creating devoted, long-term partnerships. Your aesthetic is bold and personal, reflecting your unique creative eye.',
 'You love openly and without apology. You''re warm, generous, and make your partner feel special and desired. Loyalty is non-negotiable for you—once committed, you''re all in. You create romance and beauty in relationships, turning ordinary moments into celebrations. Your partner feels genuinely valued and admired.',
 'You can be possessive or jealous, viewing your beloved as an extension of your identity. If love isn''t reciprocated with equal heat, you withdraw dramatically. You may use love as a tool for control or validation. Vanity in relationships can make you dismissive of a partner''s needs if they conflict with your image.',
 'Build love on genuine appreciation rather than mutual admiration. Practice giving without keeping score of returns. Recognize that true love sometimes means supporting your partner''s spotlight, not just your own. Vulnerability—admitting you''re hurt rather than performing strength—deepens real intimacy.',
 ARRAY['Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''ll Ever Need', 'Hand, Planets in Transit', 'Llewellyn, Venus Signs']),

('Mars', 'Leo',
 'Your drive is fierce, courageous, and unmistakably direct. You pursue goals with passionate intensity and aren''t afraid of competition. Mars in Leo burns bright—you have the energy and will to make things happen, and you do it with style.',
 'You attack life and your ambitions with boldness and creativity. Competition energizes you rather than intimidates you. Your work style is passionate and performative—you''re at your best when there''s an audience or recognition for your effort. You''ve got courage, but sometimes confuse aggressiveness with leadership.',
 'You pursue romantic interests with confident heat and aren''t subtle about desire. In bed, you''re passionate, generous, and want your partner to feel like they''re the only person in the world. You''re protective and stand up fiercely for those you love. Your sexual energy is strong, direct, and unapologetically physical.',
 'Your temper can be explosive and dramatic, though it typically burns out quickly. You may use anger as a tool to regain control or dominance. Sexual jealousy can become possessive and controlling. You can burn bright and fast, leaving projects unfinished when the initial passion fades.',
 'Channel your passion into building something meaningful rather than just conquering. Practice restraint—let others lead sometimes. Recognize that intensity without follow-through is just performance. Use your courage to protect others, not just to win. Your drive is magnificent—make it serve something bigger than ego.',
 ARRAY['Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''ll Ever Need', 'Hand, Planets in Transit', 'Arroyo, Astrology, Psychology, and the Four Elements']),

('Jupiter', 'Leo',
 'Your growth comes through creative expression, generosity, and bold vision. Jupiter in Leo expands your confidence and amplifies your natural gifts. You''re here to create, inspire, and leave a mark—and you usually do.',
 'You''re naturally optimistic and believe in your abilities, which often becomes a self-fulfilling prophecy. Opportunities come through your network and your reputation for warmth and creativity. You grow through sharing your gifts generously and taking creative risks. Your faith in yourself attracts luck, but entitlement can undermine it.',
 'You''re a generous partner and friend, offering abundance of affection and loyalty. In relationships, you help your beloved expand their sense of self-worth and possibility. You''re drawn to growth-oriented partners who inspire you. Your optimism is infectious and helps others believe in their own potential.',
 'Overconfidence can lead to overextension and unrealistic promises. You may give beyond your means, becoming financially or emotionally depleted. Pride can prevent you from asking for help when you need it. Privilege—unearned luck—can make you dismissive of others'' struggles.',
 'Balance confidence with realistic assessment. Share your gifts without expecting return. Invest in causes larger than yourself. Learn from failure without losing faith. Your luck is abundant—use it to lift others up, not just yourself. True growth comes from humility alongside belief.',
 ARRAY['Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''ll Ever Need', 'Hand, Planets in Transit', 'Forrest, The Inner Sky']),

('Saturn', 'Leo',
 'Your life lessons revolve around authenticity, responsibility, and humility. Saturn in Leo (detriment) challenges your natural Leo confidence—this is where you learn maturity. Your growth edges are here: learning to lead with wisdom, not just charisma.',
 'You face tests to your self-esteem and creative expression. Early life may have taught you that being yourself isn''t enough. You develop strength through repeatedly facing rejection or invisibility, then choosing to express yourself anyway. Your deepest security comes from discipline, not applause. You''re learning that real leadership means sacrifice.',
 'Long-term relationships require you to put your partner''s needs alongside your own. Intimacy deepens as you become less about performance and more about genuine vulnerability. You learn that being truly seen—flaws and all—is better than being admired from a distance. Your commitment becomes unshakeable over time.',
 'You can be overly self-conscious or deeply insecure masking as arrogance. Fear that you''re not special enough can create desperate need for validation. You may reject yourself before others can. Authority or criticism cuts deep because you''re learning to trust your own worth independent of external approval.',
 'Let your discipline serve your creativity, not suppress it. Practice self-acceptance on the days no one''s watching. Build something that lasts through patient, unglamorous work. Your wisdom earned through difficulty is worth more than easy success. The ultimate Leo lesson: being yourself IS enough, even when no one''s looking.',
 ARRAY['Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''ll Ever Need', 'Hand, Planets in Transit', 'Forrest, The Inner Sky']),

('Uranus', 'Leo',
 'Your generation rebels against conformity through creative expression and individuality. Uranus in Leo (depending on birth year) challenges outdated notions of leadership and self-expression. Your cohort is redefining what it means to be confident and visible.',
 'Your peer group champions authenticity and breaks traditional rules around performance and fame. You''re part of a generation that demystifies celebrity and leadership. Technology and new media are your tools for creative disruption. Your generation collectively refuses to dim their light or follow old paths to success.',
 'Your cohort values partners who are equally individual and unapologetic. Relationships are about mutual growth and authenticity, not tradition. You''re part of a generation that''s redefining loyalty and commitment on your own terms. Collaboration matters more than hierarchy.',
 'Collective rebellion without wisdom can become destructive individualism. Your generation may struggle with follow-through or building lasting structures. Chaotic creativity without discipline can leave a wake of unfinished projects. The tension between independence and connection is your generational struggle.',
 'Use your rebellious creativity to build something new, not just tear down the old. Recognize that true innovation requires both boldness and structure. Your generation''s gift is redefining authenticity—honor that by helping others find their voice, not just amplifying your own. Build community through your uniqueness.',
 ARRAY['Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''ll Ever Need', 'Forrest, The Inner Sky', 'Arroyo, Astrology, Psychology, and the Four Elements']),

('Neptune', 'Leo',
 'Your generation dreams of transcendence through creative expression and spiritual awakening. Neptune in Leo (depending on birth year) blurs the line between personal creativity and collective inspiration. Your cohort seeks meaning through art, imagination, and idealized visions.',
 'Your peer group is deeply imaginative and spiritually oriented. You''re prone to escapism through creative pursuits, fantasy, and mystical seeking. Inspiration flows easily, but grounding those dreams into reality is your challenge. Your generation romanticizes revolution and transformation. Vision without discernment is your edge.',
 'Your cohort values spiritual connection and imaginative intimacy in relationships. Partners are idealized muses more than real people. You''re drawn to profound, soulmate-style connection. Disillusionment often follows when reality can''t match your fantasy. Deep sensitivity is your gift—and your wound.',
 'Collective delusion and escapism can manifest as addiction, fantasy dependency, or spiritual bypass. Your generation may struggle to distinguish inspiration from illusion. Lack of grounding can make you unreliable or lost in your own world. Boundaries dissolve easily, leaving you vulnerable to manipulation.',
 'Ground your spiritual vision through disciplined practice. Develop discernment between inspiration and fantasy. Channel your imagination into creative work that benefits others. Your generation''s gift is visionary beauty—make it real through commitment and clarity. The spiritual is powerful only when embodied.',
 ARRAY['Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''ll Ever Need', 'Forrest, The Inner Sky', 'Arroyo, Astrology, Psychology, and the Four Elements']),

('Pluto', 'Leo',
 'Your generation transforms consciousness around power, visibility, and creative expression. Pluto in Leo (depending on birth year) revolutionizes notions of leadership and identity. Your cohort is collectively rebirthing what it means to be authentically powerful.',
 'Your peer group experiences deep psychological reckoning with ego and authenticity. You''re a generation obsessed with transformation and radical self-reinvention. Power dynamics in creativity and fame are being completely reconstructed by your cohort. You''re collectively dying to old forms of validation and being reborn into authenticity.',
 'Relationships require psychological depth and radical honesty. Your cohort demands that love be transformative or it''s not worth having. Power dynamics are constantly negotiated and renegotiated. Deep loyalty is possible, but only with partners willing to do internal work alongside you.',
 'Collective shadow around power, control, and dominance can create tyranny disguised as creativity. Your generation may be obsessively focused on personal transformation without collective responsibility. Intensity can become destructive. The line between transformation and obsession is easily crossed.',
 'Use your collective power to transform systems, not just yourself. Channel intensity into work that heals or builds. Recognize that real power comes from authenticity, not domination. Your generation''s gift is rebirth—make it serve evolution beyond the self. Transform what''s broken; don''t just destroy for destruction''s sake.';
 ARRAY['Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''ll Ever Need', 'Forrest, The Inner Sky', 'Arroyo, Astrology, Psychology, and the Four Elements']);
